"""
Sales Manager
=============

A Streamlit point-of-sale and stock system for an agricultural store selling
animal feeds (poultry, cattle, pig, goat & sheep, horse, pet, licks & supplements).
One shared SQLite database, these sections:

  • Dashboard         — sales overview (takings, profit, trend, best sellers, stock
                         alerts, expiring batches, money owed) and an expenses dashboard.
  • Point of sale     — pick the product, quantity and payment, then log the sale:
                         discount, VAT, cash / card / mobile money / on credit (with the
                         option to add a new credit customer on the spot),
                         change due, printable receipt.
  • Sales history     — search past sales, reprint receipts, void a sale
                         (stock is returned automatically).
  • Products & stock  — feed catalogue with cost & selling price, live stock,
                         restock with a quantity, stock adjustments, "open a bag" to
                         sell loose by the kg,
                         CSV / Excel import.
  • Receive stock     — deliveries from suppliers with batch & expiry date;
                         cost price is averaged automatically.
  • Customers         — farmer accounts, credit limits, unpaid credit sales,
                         payments, statements.
  • Suppliers         — supplier contacts, everything bought from each supplier at cost
                         (from Add product, Restock and Receive stock).
  • Expenses          — rent, wages, transport and other running costs; feeds the
                         expenses dashboard, net profit and the cash-up.
  • Reports           — sales, product, profit, stock valuation and an end-of-day
                         cash-up (Z report), all downloadable as PDF / CSV.
  • Settings          — store name, logo, VAT, currency, receipt footer.

Run:
    pip install streamlit pandas plotly reportlab pillow openpyxl
    streamlit run SalesManager.py
"""

